   "rawMarkdown": "Question for the host: are public weights trained on OAI knee MRI allowed?\nSeveral public notebooks attach a Kaggle dataset of weights whose description says they were trained with OAI (Osteoarthritis Initiative) knee MRIs as external supervision. OAI is free but requires registration and a data-use agreement. Under the External Data rules (“publicly available and equally accessible… at no cost”), can participants use these OAI-trained public weights, or OAI data directly? A clear ruling would help many teams. Thank you!",
   "content": "<p>Question for the host: are public weights trained on OAI knee MRI allowed?\nSeveral public notebooks attach a Kaggle dataset of weights whose description says they were trained with OAI (Osteoarthritis Initiative) knee MRIs as external supervision. OAI is free but requires registration and a data-use agreement. Under the External Data rules (“publicly available and equally accessible… at no cost”), can participants use these OAI-trained public weights, or OAI data directly? A clear ruling would help many teams. Thank you!</p>",
